# ── Security declarations ─────────────────────────
# Key Management [private_dc]: Kubernetes Secrets encrypted at rest for workloads; enterprise vault with HSM-backed keys for F5, WSO2, Kafka, HA data platforms, MFT platform, and network devices; automated rotation; no hardcoded credentials
# Key Management [azure]: Azure Key Vault with managed identities and private endpoints for Azure-owned secrets; third-party control evidence required
# Key Management [partner_keys]: CMP-11 obtains short-lived SSH certificates from the enterprise vault; dual control and automated rotation
# User Auth (Internal): INF-09 | ADFS / SAML 2.0 over TLS 1.3 with signed assertions and MFA
# User Auth (External): INF-10 | Enterprise ID / OIDC / OAuth2.0 Authorization Code with PKCE and MFA
